Package: sins
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: SiNS Team <admin@home.net>
Depends: dotnet-runtime-8.0, postgresql-client, libcap2-bin
Description: SiNS DNS Server
 A hybrid authoritative and recursive DNS server with web-based management interface.
 .
 Features:
  * Authoritative and recursive DNS server (UDP/TCP on port 53)
  * Web-based management interface (Vue.js)
  * PostgreSQL database for DNS records and configuration
  * JWT-based authentication with role-based access
  * Intelligent DNS caching with configurable TTL
  * Real-time configuration management
  * RESTful API for DNS operations
 .
 The server provides a complete DNS solution suitable for both
 authoritative and recursive DNS queries, with modern web-based
 management capabilities.

